* text=auto

# The eol=lf pins for er-archipelago-check-browser.html and er-archipelago-desc-triage.html were
# removed on 2026-09-09: those pages (and the questline DAG, region second-opinion and evidence
# browser beside them) are no longer tracked. They are built in CI and published to GitHub Pages
# / release assets -- see .gitignore and .github/workflows/pages.yaml. A checkin attribute for a
# path git never stores is a rule about nothing, and it would read as "this file is committed".
# The builders still write LF unconditionally, which is what the determinism tests assert.

*.dcx binary
*.bin binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.png binary
*.dds binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.7z  binary
*.apworld binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pdf binary
